{
  "_about": "Which products in a rep's sales analysis belong to each recap topic. 're' is a case-insensitive regular expression matched against the product name. 'feed' marks a feedstock topic that rolls up the listed topics. Topics not listed here show the recap but match no customers. Review this file each month when topics are added or renamed.",
